    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>A <strong>dungeon crawler where luck is your only weapon</strong>.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action, every event, every discovery is determined by... a <strong>slot machine</strong>. Dive into a <strong>procedurally generated dungeon</strong>, explore its mysterious depths, and let fate pull the strings of your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack, defend, loot, trade, or flee \u2014 <strong>it all depends on the spin</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An unpredictable dungeon crawler</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action is handled through a <strong>one-armed bandit</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not just luck \u2014 <strong>try to stop the reels at the right moment</strong> to trigger favorable outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine symbols</strong> to unleash powerful effects\u2026 or devastating disasters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt your strategy</strong> based on the spins and the artifacts you unlock along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spend energy</strong> to re-spin certain reels and try to improve your results.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to expect?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated maps</strong> \u2014 no dungeon is ever the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied weapons, powerful items, and incredible artifacts</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple playable classes</strong>, each with their own unique twists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goblins, skeletons, bandits, ghosts, dragons\u2026 and much worse</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious chests, shops, unexpected blessings or curses</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modify probabilities</strong>, rig your luck\u2026 or suffer the consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permadeath</strong> \u2014 every run is a unique attempt to go deeper than ever before</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Pereelous</strong>, luck is your weapon.<br><strong>Will you twist fate to your advantage\u2026 or become its eternal plaything?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>A <strong>dungeon crawler where luck is your only weapon</strong>.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action, every event, every discovery is determined by... a <strong>slot machine</strong>. Dive into a <strong>procedurally generated dungeon</strong>, explore its mysterious depths, and let fate pull the strings of your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack, defend, loot, trade, or flee \u2014 <strong>it all depends on the spin</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An unpredictable dungeon crawler</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action is handled through a <strong>one-armed bandit</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not just luck \u2014 <strong>try to stop the reels at the right moment</strong> to trigger favorable outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine symbols</strong> to unleash powerful effects\u2026 or devastating disasters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt your strategy</strong> based on the spins and the artifacts you unlock along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spend energy</strong> to re-spin certain reels and try to improve your results.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to expect?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated maps</strong> \u2014 no dungeon is ever the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied weapons, powerful items, and incredible artifacts</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple playable classes</strong>, each with their own unique twists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goblins, skeletons, bandits, ghosts, dragons\u2026 and much worse</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious chests, shops, unexpected blessings or curses</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modify probabilities</strong>, rig your luck\u2026 or suffer the consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permadeath</strong> \u2014 every run is a unique attempt to go deeper than ever before</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Pereelous</strong>, luck is your weapon.<br><strong>Will you twist fate to your advantage\u2026 or become its eternal plaything?</strong></p>",
